nd made them stronger than their adversaries.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Isaiah 11:1","note":"A shoot will come out of the stock of Jesse, and a branch out of his roots will bear fruit.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Jeremiah 3:16","note":"It will come to pass, when you are multiplied and increased in the land, in those days,” says Yahweh, “they will no longer say, ‘the ark of Yahweh’s covenant!’…","source":"web"},{"ref":"Ezekiel 19:10","note":"“ ‘Your mother was like a vine in your blood, planted by the waters. It was fruitful and full of branches by reason of many waters.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H6500","lemma":"פָּרָא","transliteration":"para","gloss":"be fruitful"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}